<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Use the <strong>Furnace</strong> to refine ores into Ingots.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Build tools and structures at the <strong>Craft Station</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Assemble advanced components at the <strong>Component Station</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Transform precious resources into higher-value goods at the <strong>Monetary Station</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each station you unlock expands your crafting possibilities and brings you one step closer to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/4fdde9712d11e4c1e10f8e316e0cd707.poster.avif?t=1759164856\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/4fdde9712d11e4c1e10f8e316e0cd707.webm?t=1759164856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/4fdde9712d11e4c1e10f8e316e0cd707.mp4?t=1759164856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/a688a71d178daf85c6ed77e95e7d4df5.avif?t=1759164856\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Digging and descending aren\u2019t free. Your energy is constantly draining. Without it, shovels dig much slower, and drills can\u2019t operate at all. Managing power remains a constant struggle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The <strong>Generator</strong> fuels stations and Elevators using Wood, Coal, or Crude Oil.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The <strong>Supply Station</strong> restores your health and energy for money.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The <strong>Power Cartridge</strong> provides a single-use energy refill in the field.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Energy directly affects your pace. Without it, progress slows or even comes to a halt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/29951d612db33c97b87aef826a1aca80.poster.avif?t=1759164856\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/29951d612db33c97b87aef826a1aca80.webm?t=1759164856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/29951d612db33c97b87aef826a1aca80.mp4?t=1759164856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/90de71c8c47c26b521f929e2997fd6ae.avif?t=1759164856\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To collect the necessary materials, you must construct the <strong>Elevator</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With ropes and foundations, you build a lifeline back to the surface. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you progress, stronger materials lead to faster and safer travel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Elevator not only carries you upward but also transports your resources and even recharges your power. It is the backbone of your exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/b3afcef8504cdab672fa5a9497fb6be9.poster.avif?t=1759164856\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/b3afcef8504cdab672fa5a9497fb6be9.webm?t=1759164856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/b3afcef8504cdab672fa5a9497fb6be9.mp4?t=1759164856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/9c5bf3ccfe8c316b468a58e6d0f91628.avif?t=1759164856\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your ultimate goal isn\u2019t just to survive, it\u2019s to escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Buried deep underground are the missing parts of your plane. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Scattered across the island lie the parts of your broken plane. The fuselage, the wings, the propeller, all waiting to be found. With avionics forged at the Component Station, the Airplane Repair Area becomes the place where your hope takes flight again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/8078e420f94c6b16768c760f24fd11b5.poster.avif?t=1759164856\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/8078e420f94c6b16768c760f24fd11b5.webm?t=1759164856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/8078e420f94c6b16768c760f24fd11b5.mp4?t=1759164856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/efc9afdd00786d4393ad4192d54cc162.avif?t=1759164856\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dig Island comes alive in <strong>4-player Co-Op</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join forces in digging, share resources, construct stations, and work as a team to <strong>restore the plane.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Communication, teamwork, and strategy are the keys to conquering the island\u2019s depths and finding your way back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/128454f8165607c51e7fa6cf95f936c3.poster.avif?t=1759164856\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/128454f8165607c51e7fa6cf95f936c3.webm?t=1759164856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/extras/128454f8165607c51e7fa6cf95f936c3.mp4?t=1759164856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["FiftyEight Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919360/f31e2bb7c85158680ac8786b91b512836422b580/header.jpg?t=1759164856","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3919360/377259326/e1ce